      "id": "claim_b84ca73fa9ca440eaddd035980a5842f",
      "statement": "A thread’s durable sandbox binding is `sandbox_id` in thread metadata, while `SANDBOX_BACKENDS` is a worker-local map of stable per-thread proxies and `SANDBOX_CONNECTIONS` caches live connections by sandbox ID; metadata lookup uses inline run metadata when it contains an ID and otherwise reads the live thread.",
